{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Soccer Time Track 是一款專為足球員而設的 Apple Watch 比賽助手，可自動統計上場時間、記錄入球與助攻，並在 iPhone 上查看跑動距離、心率等表現數據。App 原價 US $4.99，目前限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>掌握比賽表現數據</h2>\n<p>Soccer Time Track 可從 Apple Watch 記錄比賽、訓練或友誼賽，自動區分上場、低活動與場邊時間，並統計跑動距離、平均與最高速度、衝刺、心率、步頻等數據。分段時間軸與事件紀錄會在 iPhone 上呈現，亦可將訓練資料匯出為 CSV 或 JSON，方便深入了解每場表現。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-301-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-302-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-303-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-304-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-305-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1320x2868bb-306-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Soccer Time Track</li>\n<li>應用類別：Sports</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-13T02:40:06.089071+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":320,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}